# Twinflame Travelers: "If a triggered ability of another Elemental you control triggers, it triggers an additional time"
# (CR 603.2d). Bot1 has Hydro-Man, Fluid Felon (an Elemental) and Twinflame Travelers from turn 1. On turn 2 Bot2 has its
# own Hydro-Man and casts Consider, a blue spell: Bot2's Hydro-Man is an Elemental Bot1 does not control, so its "Whenever
# you cast a blue spell, if Hydro-Man is a creature, he gets +1/+1" triggers once - a 3/3. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Consider:
# its Hydro-Man's ability triggers twice (two triggers to order) and he is a 4/4.
# Turn 1 mana: Black Lotus (UUU) pays Hydro-Man's {U}{U}, the floating {U} with Mox Ruby, Mox Sapphire and the Volcanic
# Island pays Twinflame's {2}{U}{R}. Turn 3: the Volcanic Island pays Consider.

